                                                "sense_id": "b71b418e-25e5-35cc-8c80-e8833de57c0a",
                                                "text": "Each Chinese New Year during a \"Jupiter return\"—when a duodecade has passed and the Chinese zodiac animal of your birth year comes back around—it is expected that you find some red underwear to put on for the special occasion."
                                            },
